5
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:25.100
Sustainability. Say it with me. Sustainability!

6
00:00:28.621 --> 00:00:32.971
Renewable. Say it with me. Renewable!

7
00:00:36.448 --> 00:00:40.714
Ecosystem. Say it with me. Ecosystem!

8
00:00:44.231 --> 00:00:48.781
