10
00:00:59.947 --> 00:01:03.681
Footprint. Say it with me. Footprint!

11
00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:11.575
Carbon neutral. Say it with me. Carbon neutral!

12
00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:20.142
Deforestation rate. Say it with me. Deforestation rate!

13
00:01:23.637 --> 00:01:28.404
Green technology. Say it with me. Green technology!

14
00:01:31.908 --> 00:01:36.908
Circular economy. Say it with me. Circular economy!

15
00:01:40.413 --> 00:01:44.847
Biodegradable. Say it with me. Biodegradable!

16
00:01:48.337 --> 00:01:52.737
Emission target. Say it with me. Emission target!

17
00:01:56.237 --> 00:02:05.787
Grammar time! Causative have or get. Listen. We should get our habits changed to help the environment.

18
00:02:05.837 --> 00:02:11.837
Your turn. Say it with me. We should get our habits changed to help the environment.

19
00:02:16.729 --> 00:02:25.305
Sustainability means protecting the ecosystem for future generations. Renewable energy helps reduce our carbon footprint.

20
00:02:25.355 --> 00:02:26.793
I like this story!

21
00:02:27.483 --> 00:02:32.675
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:32.725 --> 00:02:33.903
Ecosystem!

23
00:02:35.277 --> 00:02:40.761
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:40.811 --> 00:02:42.269
Carbon neutral!

25
00:02:43.186 --> 00:02:51.716
Think and answer. What can individuals do to fight climate change?

26
00:02:51.766 --> 00:02:52.916
Great answer!

27
00:02:54.019 --> 00:02:56.326
This unit's value is Stewardship.

28
00:02:56.376 --> 00:02:58.310
I can show stewardship every day!

29
00:02:58.986 --> 00:03:03.688
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:03:03.738 --> 00:03:05.401
